{"ticker":"FDS","updated":"2026-10-30T22:48:15Z","profile":{"longName":"FactSet Research Systems Inc.","shortName":"FactSet Research Systems Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.factset.com","fullTimeEmployees":12444,"marketCap":11623891968,"trailingPE":22.619768,"forwardPE":15.165515,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.69414,"pegRatio":1.09,"targetMeanPrice":280.625,"targetHighPrice":340.0,"targetLowPrice":212.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.063,"earningsGrowth":-0.154,"grossMargins":0.50605,"operatingMargins":0.22215,"profitMargins":0.21544,"totalRevenue":2476256000,"beta":0.766,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":339.83,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":185.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.45},"summary":"FactSet Research Systems Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a global data and artificial intelligence solutions provider for the financial markets in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia Pacific. It offers data, products, and analytical applications; and workstations, portfolio analytics, and enterprise data solutions, as well as managed services for supporting data, performance, risk and reporting, and AI-enabled workflows. The company also provides financial data and market intelligence on securities, companies, industries, and people that enable clients to research advisory, dealmaking and investment ideas, as well as analyze, monitor, and manage portfolios; and solutions covering investment lifecycle of investment research, portfolio construction and analysis, trade execution, performance measurement, risk management, and reporting. In addition, it offers banking solutions that supports company and market research; wealth solutions which supports home office, advisory, and client engagement workflows; and data and technology offerings, including desktop and mobile platform, data solutions, cloud-based digital solutions, application programming interfaces, and model context protocol servers. The company serves professionals, including institutional asset managers, bankers, wealth managers, asset owners, partners, hedge funds, corporate users","summary_zh":"FactSet Research Systems Inc. 及其子公司是一家全球數據和人工智慧解決方案提供商，為美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區的金融市場提供服務。它提供數據、產品和分析應用程式；和工作站、投資組合分析和企業數據解決方案，以及用於支援數據、效能、風險和報告以及人工智慧工作流程的託管服務。該公司還提供有關證券、公司、行業和人員的金融數據和市場情報，使客戶能夠研究諮詢、交易和投資理念，以及分析、監控和管理投資組合；以及涵蓋投資研究、投資組合構建和分析、交易執行、績效衡量、風險管理和報告的投資生命週期的解決方案。此外，它還提供支援公司和市場研究的銀行解決方案；支援家庭辦公室、諮詢和客戶參與工作流程的財富解決方案；數據和技術產品，包括桌面和行動平台、數據解決方案、基於雲端的數位解決方案、應用程式介面和模型上下文協議伺服器。公司服務專業人士，包括機構資產管理者、銀行家、財富管理者、資產所有者、合夥人、對沖基金、企業用戶","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":371.93,"h":372.88,"l":362.41,"c":368.88,"v":499000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":367.37,"h":371.03,"l":365.62,"c":370.8,"v":297600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":372.06,"h":372.06,"l":366.12,"c":369.48,"v":348300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":370.39,"h":373.1,"l":368.55,"c":371.01,"v":313600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":371.53,"h":377.07,"l":369.44,"c":375.34,"v":500500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":372.8,"h":375.5,"l":368.7,"c":372.86,"v":399600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":371.53,"h":371.53,"l":360.82,"c":361.76,"v":437700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":363.36,"h":370.61,"l":362.34,"c":370.5,"v":454300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":370.01,"h":370.98,"l":361.73,"c":361.84,"v":444400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":363.33,"h":364.83,"l":343.6,"c":344.43,"v":842800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":344.14,"h":346.28,"l":341.79,"c":345.19,"v":639700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":345.94,"h":348.39,"l":332.8,"c":336.04,"v":1082500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":338.53,"h":338.53,"l":297.86,"c":301.23,"v":2608100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":304.5,"h":304.75,"l":288.84,"c":289.15,"v":1781600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":294.5,"h":301.75,"l":293.86,"c":295.63,"v":1391600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":296.4,"h":296.77,"l":286.52,"c":288.41,"v":1100000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":288.0,"h":291.22,"l":284.39,"c":286.16,"v":934