is a global data and artificial intelligence (\"AI\") solutions provider to the financial markets with open and flexible technologies that deliver financial intelligence to finance professionals worldwide.","zh":"FactSet 是一家面向金融市場的全球數據和人工智慧 (“AI”) 解決方案提供商，擁有開放靈活的技術，為全球金融專業人士提供金融智慧。"},{"en":"Our platform delivers expansive data, sophisticated analytics, and flexible, AI-powered technologies used by global financial professionals to power their critical investment, dealmaking and advisory workflows. As of August 31, 2026, we had more than 9,200 clients and over 260,000 professionals using our solutions, including institutional asset managers, bankers, wealth managers, asset owners, partners, hedge fund professionals, corporate users, private equity and venture capital professionals, and market infrastructure participants. Our revenues are primarily derived from subscriptions to our multi-asset class data and solutions that include workstations, portfolio analytics, enterprise data solutions, and AI solutions. We also offer managed services that operate as an extension of our clients' internal teams to support data, performance, risk and reporting, and AI-enabled workflows.","zh":"我們的平台提供廣泛的數據、複雜的分析以及靈活的人工智慧技術，供全球金融專業人士使用，為他們的關鍵投資、交易和諮詢工作流程提供支援。截至 2026 年 8 月 31 日，我們有超過 9,200 名客戶和超過 260,000 名專業人士使用我們的解決方案，包括機構資產管理者、銀行家、財富管理者、資產所有者、合作夥伴、對沖基金專業人士、企業用戶、私募股權和風險投資專業人士以及市場基礎設施​​參與者。我們的收入主要來自訂閱我們的多元資產類數據和解決方案，包括工作站、投資組合分析、企業數據解決方案和人工智慧解決方案。我們還提供託管服務，作為客戶內部團隊的延伸，支援數據、績效、風險和報告以及人工智慧支援的工作流程。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Americas: The Americas segment primarily sells to clients in North, Central and South America. In the Americas, we have offices in eight states in the United States (\"U.S.\"). Additionally, we have data centers in two states in the U.S. and an office in each of Brazil and Canada. Revenues from the Americas represented 65% of total revenues during fiscal 2026.","zh":"美洲：美洲部門主要北美洲、中美洲和南美洲的客戶銷售產品。在美洲，我們在美國（「美國」）的八個州設有辦事處。此外，我們在美國兩州設有資料中心，並在巴西和加拿大各設有一個辦事處。 2026 財年，來自美洲的收入佔總收入的 65%。"},{"en":"EMEA: The EMEA segment primarily sells to clients in Europe, the Middle East and Africa via offices in Bulgaria, France, Germany, Italy, Latvia, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, Sweden, the United Arab Emirates and the United Kingdom (\"UK\"). Revenues from EMEA represented 24% of total revenues during fiscal 2026.","zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲：歐洲、中東和非洲部門主要透過保加利亞、法國、德國、義大利、拉脫維亞、盧森堡、荷蘭、瑞典、阿拉伯聯合大公國和英國（「英國」）的辦事處向歐洲、中東和非洲的客戶銷售產品。 2026 財年，來自 EMEA 的收入佔總收入的 24%。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1617438000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":605339000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":253479000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":2476256000},"geo":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1516107000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":717565000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"GB","val":242584000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":2476256000}},"peers":["JKHY","BRO","IT","MSCI","MKTX"]}}